sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as Streamlit
    participant Prep as preprocessing
    participant Lda as LDA
    participant Enc as RoBERT
    participant Bert as BERTopic
    User->>App: paste Romanian news text
    App->>Prep: clean_text
    Prep-->>App: cleaned tokens
    App->>Lda: BoW inference
    Lda-->>App: top topic mixture
    App->>Enc: encode text
    Enc-->>App: embedding vector
    App->>Bert: transform
    Bert-->>App: topic id and keywords
    App-->>User: side by side cards
